        <tr><th>US Reportable (FATCA)</th><th>Other Reportable (Other than FATCA)</th></tr>
        <tr><td>F1- Owner- Documented FI<br>with specified US owner(s)</td><td>C1- Passive Non- Financial Entity with one or more controlling person that is a Reportable person</td></tr>
        <tr><td>F2 -Passive Non –Financial Entity with substantial US owner(s)</td><td>C2– Other Reportable Person</td></tr>
        <tr><td>F3- Non- Participating FFI</td><td>C3- Passive Non- Financial Entity that is a CRS Reportable</td></tr>
